From: Easy Buy <122056680+Volttaik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 11:02:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Expose playable qualities and durations for video/short/album
 rows
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

buildVideoRow/buildShortRow now return a server-authoritative `qualities`
array (single Auto entry today since no transcoding pipeline exists; [] when
locked so no media URL leaks) plus the existing duration metadata, and album
items gain qualities + duration_secs. The mobile player renders a quality
selector only when the server offers multiple variants.

